WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.737
You may wanna change the budget of your existing sponsored products campaigns at some point.

00:00:04.737 --> 00:00:05.368
Here's how.

00:00:05.368 --> 00:00:10.737
From your list of active campaigns, in the Budget column, click the Current Amount and add more

00:00:10.737 --> 00:00:15.789
budget if your high-performing campaign is often running out, or decrease it if your campaign's

00:00:15.789 --> 00:00:17.053
not meeting your goals.

00:00:17.053 --> 00:00:18.947
Hit Save to activate your changes.

00:00:18.947 --> 00:00:24.632
Another way is by clicking into the Campaign and going to the Settings tab, which is helpful if

00:00:24.632 --> 00:00:26.526
you wanna make other settings adjustments.

00:00:26.526 --> 00:00:30.000
From here, simply adjust your daily budget in the same way.
